# Optional release signing. Copy to keystore.properties (gitignored) in the project root and fill in
# all four values, or set the equivalent environment variables / Gradle properties instead:
#   MARQUEE_KEYSTORE_FILE      / -Pmarquee.keystore.file
#   MARQUEE_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD  / -Pmarquee.keystore.password
#   MARQUEE_KEY_ALIAS          / -Pmarquee.key.alias
#   MARQUEE_KEY_PASSWORD       / -Pmarquee.key.password
# With none of them set, assembleRelease builds app-release-unsigned.apk. A partial set fails the build.
# storeFile (and MARQUEE_KEYSTORE_FILE / -Pmarquee.keystore.file): a relative path resolves against the
# project root (the directory containing settings.gradle.kts), not against app/; "~" is not expanded.
# An absolute path is recommended. Never commit a keystore or this filled-in file.
storeFile=/absolute/path/to/release.jks
storePassword=
keyAlias=
keyPassword=
